{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q26205252","formula":"Mg₈Ca₈(UO₂)₂₄(CO₃)₃₀O₄(OH)₁₂(H₂O)₁₃₈","hill":"C30H288Ca8Mg8O292U24","elements":["H","C","O","Mg","Ca","U"],"composition":{"C":30.0,"H":288.0,"O":292.0,"U":24.0,"Ca":8.0,"Mg":8.0},"names":{"en":"Ewingite","uk":"Юїнґіт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Ewingite is a complex hydrous uranyl carbonate mineral of magnesium and calcium. Its chemical formula is Mg8Ca8(UO2)24(CO3)30O4(OH)12 · 138 H2O. It was discovered by Jakub Plášil of the Institute of Physics at the Academy of Sciences of the Czech Republic in the Plavno mine, Czech Republic. Travis Olds of the University of Notre Dame and colleagues described ewingite, which is the most structurally complex known mineral on Earth.","uk":"Юїнґіт — складний гідратний мінерал, уранілкарбонат магнію та кальцію. Його хімічна формула Mg8Ca8(UO2)24(CO3)30O4(OH)12 · 138 H2O. Його відкрив Якуб Плашіл з Інституту фізики Академії наук Чеської Республіки в копальні «Плавно», Чехія. Тревіс Олдс з Університету Нотр-Дам та його колеги описали юїнгіт, який є структурно найскладнішим відомим мінералом на Землі."},"fame":5,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q26205252","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ewingite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%AE%D1%97%D0%BD%D2%91%D1%96%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q417730","formula":"Ca₂(UO₂)(CO₃)₃·11H₂O","names":{"en":"Liebigite","uk":"Лібігіт"},"elements":["H","C","O","Ca","U"],"fame":13,"kind":null},{"id":"Q3978592","formula":"MgCa(UO₂)(CO₃)₃*12H₂O","names":{"en":"Swartzite","uk":"Cвартцит"},"ele